      "9_broad_abilities_what_most_score_repo": " (9 broad abilities — what most score reports show), and ",
      "a_comprehensive_cognitive_battery_must": "a \"comprehensive cognitive battery\" must sample multiple narrow abilities per broad area. A single subtest score = unreliable estimate of the broad construct.",
      "a_standard_score_of_100_with_r_95_sem_": "A standard score of 100 with r=.95, SEM=3 vs r=.75, SEM=10 — which is action-ready and why?",
      "a_wisc_iii_score_from_1992_and_a_wisc_": "A WISC-III score from 1992 and a WISC-V score from 2024 are not directly comparable.",
