      "inquiry_widget_no_score_no_reveal_no_a": "Inquiry widget — no score, no reveal, no answer dump. CIs assume normal sampling distribution; for very small samples use the appropriate t-distribution. Reliability is necessary but not sufficient — validity matters too. Always consult test manuals and standards (AAIDD-12, AERA/APA/NCME Standards).",
