      "identity_first_language_follows_commun": "💡 Identity-first language follows community-consensus norms (Kenny et al. 2016; Bury et al. 2020; Taboas et al. 2023). The Behavior Lab teaches the science of behavior; this panel teaches the ethics of applying it to humans who can tell us what they want.",
