      "pile_of_empty_shells_crab_clam_snail_o": "Pile of empty shells (crab, clam, snail) outside a crevice. The most reliable octopus-den indicator. Octopuses are tidy eaters — they discard shells in a \"trash heap\" near their entry. Look at the bottom of rocky walls.",
      "pioneer_of_cephalopod_cognition_explai": "Pioneer of cephalopod cognition explains why octopus intelligence is genuinely different from vertebrate intelligence.",
      "pippa_ehrlich_james_reed_s_documentary": "Pippa Ehrlich + James Reed's documentary about Craig Foster's relationship with a kelp-forest octopus wins the Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature.",
