      "despite_the_myth_all_bats_can_see_frui": "Despite the myth, all bats can see. Fruit bats have large eyes with excellent night vision. Even echolocating bats use vision for long-range navigation — they use landmarks and the sunset glow to orient during migration.",
      "did_you_know_amazing_sound_facts": "💡 Did You Know? — Amazing Sound Facts",
