      "drag_the_sliders_to_mix_your_own_type_": "Drag the sliders to mix your own type-metal alloy. The quality of the cast — dimensional accuracy, hardness, mold fill, durability — responds in real time. Try going to extremes to see what fails, then dial back to the historical Gutenberg-era target.",
