      "for_solo_cold_water_survival_while_wea": "For solo cold-water survival while wearing a life jacket. Knees pulled to chest, arms crossed over chest, body curled. Reduces heat loss through the body's biggest blood-flow zones (groin, armpits, sides of chest).",
